        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 mb-1">
            <div class="text-base font-semibold leading-snug">Director of Product Design</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[#93908B] shrink-0 font-mono">2025 – Present</div>
          </div>
          <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com" target="_blank" class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#c44800] hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-150 mb-3 block">Cloudflare</a>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#93908B] leading-relaxed">Leading design across Security and Performance, Cloudflare's highest-revenue portfolio. A global team of 11, VP-level partnerships, and an organisation-wide shift to AI-native design practice.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="py-8 flex gap-8 group">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-white dark:bg-[#2A2A28] border border-[#DAD9D2] dark:border-[#3A3A38] shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
          <img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=cloudflare.com&sz=64" alt="Cloudflare" class="w-4 h-4 object-contain">
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 mb-1">
            <div class="text-base font-semibold leading-snug">Design Lead → Senior Design Manager</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[#93908B] shrink-0 font-mono">2019 – 2025</div>
          </div>
          <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com" target="_blank" class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#c44800] hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-150 mb-3 block">Cloudflare</a>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#93908B] leading-relaxed">Built and scaled the London design team from the ground up. Led design across Security, Performance, and Analytics. Shipped the WAF redesign, Firewall Events, and Analytics platforms from 0–1.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="py-8 flex gap-8 group">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-white dark:bg-[#2A2A28] border border-[#DAD9D2] dark:border-[#3A3A38] shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
          <img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=geckoboard.com&sz=64" alt="Geckoboard" class="w-full h-full object-contain">
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 mb-1">
            <div class="text-base font-semibold leading-snug">Product Design Lead</div>
            <div class="text-xs text-[#93908B] shrink-0 font-mono">2013 – 2018</div>
          </div>
          <a href="https://www.geckoboard.com" target="_blank" class="text-xs font-semibold tracking-widest uppercase text-[#1a7a2e] hover:opacity-80 transition-opacity duration-150 mb-3 block">Geckoboard</a>
          <p class="text-sm text-[#93908B] leading-relaxed">Joined as the sole designer and shaped the design function over 4.5 years at a SaaS dashboarding tool used by thousands of businesses. Owned end-to-end product design across web and mobile.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="py-8 flex gap-8 group">
        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-white dark:bg-[#2A2A28] border border-[#DAD9D2] dark:border-[#3A3A38] shrink-0 flex items-center justify-center mt-0.5">
          <img src="https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=huddle.com&sz=64" alt="Huddle" class="w-full h-full object-contain">
        </div>
        <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
          <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4 mb-1">
            <div class="text-base font-semibold leading-snug">Product Designer</div>
